---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroSlider from './HeroSlider.astro';
import ActionStrip from './ActionStrip.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import AssessmentOffer from './AssessmentOffer.astro';
import EvidenceLinks from './EvidenceLinks.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import AnalogyStories from './AnalogyStories.astro';
import LifePath from './LifePath.astro';
import emblem from '../assets/pinnacle-emblem-official.png';
import communicationJourney from '../assets/speech-communication-journey-branded-20260929.png';
import TherapyTogether from './TherapyTogether.astro';
import { speechContent, serviceInformationPath } from '../data/speech-content';
import shareCard from '../assets/speech-share-20260928.png';
import firstVisit from '../assets/speech-first-visit.png';
import decisionArt from '../assets/speech-observe-adjust-20260928.png';
import VisitInfographic from './VisitInfographic.astro';
import SpeechResources from './SpeechResources.astro';
import { speechOffer } from '../data/speech-offer';
import CentreDirectory from './CentreDirectory.astro';
import { phone, url, speechPath } from '../data/site';
import { steps, stepSources, proofCards } from '../data/speech';
const { focused = false } = Astro.props;
const content = speechContent;
---
<PageLayout updatedOn="2026-09-29" enquiry={content.enquiry} path={content.path} label={content.label} serviceName={content.name} serviceType={content.type} assessmentOffer={content.assessmentOffer} title={content.title} description={content.description} citations={content.citations} faqs={content.faqs} imageAlt="A Pinnacle Blooms speech-therapy card showing an Indian mother and child using picture cards, with the message Be understood, Make choices, Join in and the phone number 9100 181 181." imageCaption="Speech therapy for children at Pinnacle Blooms Network." shareImage={shareCard} focused={focused}>
  <HeroSlider content={content} /><ActionStrip focused />

  <section class="section speech-age-journey" aria-labelledby="speech-age-journey-title"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From first gestures to school participation</p><h2 id="speech-age-journey-title">Communication grows<br/><em>through everyday life.</em></h2></div><p>Around 9 months, communication may begin with shared attention, sounds and gestures. Through the early years, it can grow into words, choices, conversation, play and classroom participation. We begin with what your child can do now and what would matter next.</p></div>
    <figure class="speech-age-visual"><Image src={communicationJourney} widths={[480,760,1100,1536]} sizes="(min-width:1100px) 1100px, calc(100vw - 36px)" width={1536} height={864} format="webp" quality={82} loading="eager" alt="An Indian mother and preschool child communicating through play, with connected scenes of a baby using gestures and a seven-year-old participating in class. The official Pinnacle emblem and evidence labels are shown in the artwork."/><figcaption>One connected communication journey—from early shared attention toward greater participation at home, in learning and at school. <a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/md5.html')}>MD-5</a> · <a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/bis.html')}>BIS scope</a> · <a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Citations</a>. Assessment, goals and progress remain individual.</figcaption></figure>
  </div></section>

  <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="ChildrenServices-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="wrap service-fit" id="service-fit" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
    <div class="fit-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your child. Your everyday priorities.</p><h2 id="fit-title">What would you like<br /><em>to become easier?</em></h2></div>
    <div class="concern-grid">{content.concerns.map(concern=><article><span class="concern-icon"><Icon name={concern.icon} size={30} /></span><h3>{concern.title}</h3><p>{concern.copy}</p></article>)}</div>
    <p class="source-note">Tell us what you are noticing. If speech is getting stuck or hearing is a concern, we’ll discuss the appropriate professional next step. <a href="https://www.asha.org/public/early-identification-of-speech-language-and-hearing-disorders/">ASHA communication guidance ↗</a></p>
    <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="assessment-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="assessment-route" id="assessment-start"><a href="#first-visit"><Icon name="clock"/> Your first visit</a><a href="#centres"><Icon name="pin"/> Find your centre</a><a href={serviceInformationPath}><Icon name="book"/> Assessment details</a></div>
    <EvidenceLinks group="measurement" label="Understand how we build the starting picture" />
  </section>

  <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="procedure-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="first-visit-section section" id="first-visit" aria-labelledby="visit-title"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="visit-story"><div class="visit-story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Your first step</p><h2 id="visit-title">Bring your questions.<br /><em>Let’s find a starting point.</em></h2><p>Tell us what matters to your family. We explore how your child communicates through conversation, play, structured tasks and observation, then explain the findings and next steps.</p>
      <div class="visit-facts"><div><Icon name="clock" size={27} /><strong>About 1 hour</strong><span>Assessment, depending on your child.</span></div><div><Icon name="book" size={27} /><strong>A written report</strong><span>We’ll confirm when your report will be ready.</span></div><div><Icon name="plan" size={27} /><AssessmentOffer /><span>Speech &amp; language assessment.</span></div></div>
      <a class="button primary" href={speechOffer.url} data-cta="visit-enquiry">Arrange your FREE assessment <Icon name="arrow" /></a><p class="visit-price-note"><a href={serviceInformationPath}>Assessment details and current offer ↗</a>. Our team will contact you to confirm the centre and appointment. Ongoing therapy is priced separately.</p>
    </div><figure class="visit-story-art"><Image src={firstVisit} widths={[480,720,1000]} sizes="(min-width: 1360px) 620px, (min-width: 761px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 36px)" width={1000} height={667} format="webp" quality={80} alt="Illustrative first visit: a mother and therapist listen as a child chooses a picture card." loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="visit-art-note"><Icon name="heart" size={27} /><strong>Your child.<br />Your questions.<br /><em>A shared starting point.</em></strong></div></figure></div>
    <VisitInfographic /><p class="source-note"><a href="/speech-therapy/first-visit-guide">Print or share your first-visit guide ↗</a></p>
    <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="Cost-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><details class="visit-practical" id="session-details"><summary>Session structure, fees and what to confirm <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Our <a href={serviceInformationPath}>speech-service guide</a> describes 40 minutes of therapy plus 5 minutes of parent review. Before you book, we’ll confirm your therapist, qualifications, appointment and report timings, session structure and any ongoing therapy fees. Bring relevant reports, your questions and examples of communication at home or school. Your appointment is arranged with the centre.</p></details>
    <div class="parent-part" id="family-practice"><Icon name="people" size={36} /><div><h3>Your knowledge of your child belongs in the plan.</h3><p>We help you turn agreed goals into manageable practice in your routines. Tell us what engaged your child, where help was needed and what did not work. We use those observations with you to shape the next step.</p></div></div>
    <EvidenceLinks group="practice" label="Support for everyday practice and family participation" />
  </div></section>

  <AnalogyStories />

  <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="Advantages-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="section wrap difference" id="pinnacle-difference" aria-labelledby="difference-title">
    <div class="story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Seven connected stages · One life in view</p><h2 id="difference-title">Start with the life.<br /><em>Work toward it every day.</em></h2><p>Your child’s life gives every session its purpose. With you, we choose the abilities, goals, people, methods and everyday practice that serve it—and review the work as your child grows.</p></div>
    <p class="life-purpose-line">The life we work toward: <strong>self-sufficiency · mainstream inclusion · a wonderful life.</strong></p>
    <LifePath pathway={content.pathway} />
    <a class="text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>Read the complete PinnacleAI paradigm-shift story <Icon name="arrow" /></a>

  </section>

  <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="what-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="section wrap example-section" id="everyday-communication" aria-labelledby="example-title">
    <div class="story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Small moments. Everyday possibilities.</p><h2 id="example-title">A way to ask.<br /><em>A chance to take part.</em></h2><p>Speech therapy supports understanding, expression and interaction. At Pinnacle, we connect those skills to the life your child is working toward.</p></div>
    <figure class="decision-art"><Image src={decisionArt} widths={[480,800,1200,1672]} sizes="(min-width:1360px) 1280px, calc(100vw - 36px)" width={1672} height={941} format="webp" quality={78} alt="Illustrative sequence: a child brings a closed toy box, uses a picture card with support, and the family reviews the next practice step with a professional." loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption><span><strong>Choose a goal.</strong>A way to ask for help.</span><span><strong>Notice what happens.</strong>What support made it possible?</span><span><strong>Adjust the practice.</strong>Plan the next familiar situation.</span></figcaption></figure>
    <div class="worked-example">
      <div class="example-goal"><span class="example-label">An illustrative everyday goal</span><div class="spoken-goal"><Icon name="voice" size={48} /><strong>“I need help.”</strong></div><p>At home or school. Through speech, gestures or another appropriate communication method.</p></div>
      <ol class="example-scenes decision-scenes">
        <li><span class="example-scene-icon"><Icon name="heart" size={34} /></span><span class="example-step">Notice + listen</span><h3>“Help me open it.”</h3><p>A child brings a closed toy box to an adult. The family wants asking for help to become easier.</p></li>
        <li><span class="example-scene-icon"><Icon name="measure" size={34} /></span><span class="example-step">Understand + agree</span><h3>Know the starting point.</h3><p>We assess the starting point with the family and agree a suitable way to ask. Together, we observe where it happens and how much support is needed.</p></li>
        <li><span class="example-scene-icon"><Icon name="home" size={34} /></span><span class="example-step">Practise + observe</span><h3>Make room for it in life.</h3><p>We work with the family to choose familiar moments to practise the agreed communication method with appropriate support.</p></li>
        <li><span class="example-scene-icon"><Icon name="track" size={34} /></span><span class="example-step">Review the evidence</span><h3>What worked—and where?</h3><p>In this example, the child asks one familiar adult after a prompt. We still need to observe whether they can ask another adult.</p></li>
        <li class="changed-decision"><span class="example-scene-icon"><Icon name="loop" size={34} /></span><span class="example-step">Change the next decision</span><h3>Keep the goal. Adjust the practice.</h3><p>We agree with the family how to practise with another familiar adult, what support to use and what to review next.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="technology-bridge"><Icon name="plan" size={30} /><p><strong>Where PinnacleAI fits.</strong> Its ability measurement, readiness tracking, progress forecasting and adaptive plan support help us organise the work. Our professionals review the observations with your family and guide the next step. <a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/md5.html')}>See the licensed software scope ↗</a></p></div>
    <div class="review-question"><Icon name="track" size={27} /><p>The question we keep coming back to:<br /><strong>Where can your child use this—and with how much help?</strong></p></div>
    <p class="source-note">Illustrative example, not a patient case. We agree each child’s own goals and support with their family. <a href="https://www.asha.org/njc/communication-bill-of-rights/">Communication rights · NJC / ASHA ↗</a></p>
    <EvidenceLinks group="review" label="See how observations lead to the next decision" />
    <details class="technical-walkthrough" id="pinnacleai-steps"><summary><span><strong>Inside PinnacleAI: nine explanations of the technology</strong><small>Optional detail: how measurement, planning, practice and review connect.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="technical-content"><p class="source-note">Here is how PinnacleAI supports our seven-stage family pathway. These nine explanations describe its philosophy and technology, not a separate nine-stage treatment programme.</p>
      <ol class="stack-grid">{steps.map((step,i)=><li class:list={['stack-card','phase-'+(Math.floor(i/3)+1)]}><div class="technical-step"><span class="step-top"><span class="step-number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><Icon name={step.icon} size={27} /></span><h3>{step.title}</h3><strong>{step.layer}</strong><p>{step.detail}</p><a href={url(stepSources[i])}>See the supporting record ↗</a></div></li>)}</ol>
      <p class="source-note">PinnacleAI GPT-OS v1.0.0 is non-diagnostic developmental-support software for children aged 0–12. Professionals guide care decisions with the family. You can inspect the programme and licence records behind these explanations.</p>
    </div></details>
  </section>

  <TherapyTogether current="speech" />

  <CentreDirectory />

  <SpeechResources />

  <section class="section evidence-section" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Open. Honest. Transparent. Self-critical.</p><h2 id="evidence-title">Confidence you can<br /><em>look into.</em></h2></div><p>We make the records behind our work available to you: the software licence, its named modules and research relevant to communication. Follow a source as deeply as you wish.</p></div>
    <div class="evidence-cards">{proofCards.map((card,i)=><article><span class="proof-icon"><Icon name={['shield','plan','measure'][i]} size={35} /></span><p class="card-tag">{card.tag}</p><h3>{card.title}</h3><p>{card.text}</p><span class="record-reference">{card.ref}</span><a class="text-link" href={url(card.link)}>{card.label} ↗</a></article>)}</div>
    <p class="source-note">Software licences describe the named device and documented scope. Research findings apply to the populations and methods studied. Your child’s goals and progress are individual.</p>
    <details class="research-detail"><summary>AbilityScore research: what is published and what is planned <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><ul><li><a href={url('/verify/evidence/research-library.html#zenodo-19482123')}>Methodology and preliminary findings</a> — how AbilityScore is constructed; preliminary operational measurement findings.</li><li><a href={url('/verify/evidence/research-library.html#zenodo-19482476')}>External-validation protocol</a> — a planned study; it does not report completed external-validation results.</li></ul></details>
    <div class="institution-story" id="organisation-behind-care">
      <div class="story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The organisation behind your child’s care</p><h3>Our work. Our responsibility.<br /><em>Our records, open to you.</em></h3><p>Pinnacle Blooms Network is a brand of Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited. We publish the records behind our identity, systems and PinnacleAI journey so you can make an informed choice.</p></div>
      <div class="institution-grid">
        <div><Icon name="shield" size={28} /><h4>Quality and information security</h4><p>Explore our quality-management and information-security certificates, their named system scopes and review dates.</p><EvidenceLinks group="quality" label="Our system certificates" /></div>
        <div><Icon name="people" size={28} /><h4>An accountable organisation</h4><p>Know the legal organisation behind Pinnacle and read the independent limited-assurance report on specified institutional claims.</p><EvidenceLinks group="identity" label="Identity and institutional records" /></div>
        <div><Icon name="compass" size={28} /><h4>From our purpose to our milestones</h4><p>Follow the complete PinnacleAI story, including the Free Sale Certificate for export subject to the importing country’s law.</p><EvidenceLinks group="journey" label="The wider PinnacleAI story" /></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-bottom"><a class="button outline" href={url('/verify/')}><Icon name="book" />Explore Pinnacle Verify</a><a class="text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/research-library.html')}>Research &amp; publication status →</a><a class="text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacleai-regulatory-journey.html')}>Full story, including the Free Sale Certificate →</a></div>
    <p class="source-note source-downloads"><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/speech-evidence.txt">Claims and sources for this page</a> · <a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/speech-evidence.json">Download source map (JSON)</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section wrap faq-section" id="questions" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you decide</p><h2 id="faq-title">Clear answers.<br /><em>A simpler next step.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="https://www.asha.org/public/early-identification-of-speech-language-and-hearing-disorders/">Communication development · ASHA ↗</a></div><div>{content.faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>

  <span class="legacy-section-anchor" id="admission-section" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="final-cta" id="next-step" aria-labelledby="next-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="close-sun official-close"><Image src={emblem} width={96} height={96} format="webp" loading="lazy" alt="Pinnacle official pinwheel emblem" /></div><p class="eyebrow">Every Child Counts®</p><h2 id="next-title">Your hopes deserve<br />a clear next step.</h2><p>Tell us what you want to become easier for your child.<br />We’ll help you arrange a FREE assessment, find a centre and understand the next step.</p><div class="final-actions"><a class="button white" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call"><Icon name="phone" />Call {phone.display}</a><a class="button light-outline" href={speechOffer.url} data-cta="final-enquiry">Arrange your FREE assessment <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div><div class="close-moments"><span><Icon name="voice" />A way to ask.</span><span><Icon name="heart" />A choice to make.</span><span><Icon name="people" />A life to take part in.</span></div><p class="final-guidance">FREE speech assessment · Free guidance, 24/7 · Ongoing therapy is priced separately.</p><a class="helpline-link" href={url('/national-autism-helpline')}>Pinnacle / BHCL National Autism Helpline →</a></div></section>

<script>
  function revealLinkedDetails(){
    let hash=''; try { hash=decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1)); } catch { return; }
    if(hash==='Cost-section'||hash==='session-details'){
      const details=document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('#session-details');
      if(details){details.open=true;details.scrollIntoView({block:'start'});}
    }
  }
  revealLinkedDetails();
  window.addEventListener('hashchange',revealLinkedDetails);

</script>

</PageLayout>
